  "description": "A result cache for SQL Server and Azure SQL that sits in front of the database as a gateway. Clients connect to DaffyZoom as if it were SQL Server. Everything is relayed byte for byte, except repeats of slow queries on tables that rarely change, which are answered from an encrypted local cache in a fraction of the time. Fails closed: whenever it is unsure, the query goes to SQL Server.",
